\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Routing algorithm exploration efficiency. The scatter plot compares physical path distance against the number of expanded graph nodes in the visited set for Dijkstra, A*, and BFS. Heuristic pruning in A* Search (slope 0.35) yields a flatter slope compared to Dijkstra (slope 0.64) and BFS (slope 2.15), demonstrating significantly better scaling as distance to destination increases.}}{5}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:algorithms}{{3}{5}{}{figure.3}{}}
\@writefile{toc}{\contentsline {subsection}{\numberline {\mbox  {III-D}}Agent-Based Simulation Engine}{5}{}\protected@file@percent }
