\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Evacuation scaling telemetry. The figure plots average network congestion ratio and algorithm execution runtimes as the active agent population scales from 100 to 2,000. Dijkstra and A* runtimes scale sub-linearly under load, with A* query latency remaining below 2.5 ms at peak populations, confirming the feasibility of real-time client-side evacuation simulations.}}{7}{}\protected@file@percent }
